WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.600
Two tools read that file.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.183
The first, kit calls, prints what
a task needs on each system,

3
00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:09.810
and with the granted option it compares
what an integration user actually

4
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:14.512
holds against that need, exiting with
a failure on anything missing or extra.

5
00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:18.987
Grants are typed or exported by the
operator; it never touches the network.

6
00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:22.467
The second is the test that
holds the code to the list:

7
00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:27.322
it runs every client against a fake
HTTP session and checks each request,

8
00:00:27.322 --> 00:00:31.030
by method and whole path,
against the rows for that task.
